LICENSE, NOTICE, and licenses/* provide attribution and license notices;
preserve the applicable notices when redistributing licensed material.
The manifest's AND expression records these file-level license boundaries.
It does not relicense the adapted library as MIT-0.

Generated documents:
  Authors retain rights in their own original text and research. Sharing an
  output that contains or adapts protected upstream material may carry that
  material's license obligations; this package grants no blanket exception.
  The supplied sample PDF and preview images may be shared under CC-BY-SA-4.0.

Fonts:
  No font files are distributed. The default EB Garamond and Garamond-Math fonts
  are separately available under OFL-1.1; retain their licenses and notices
  if redistributing them separately.
  EB Garamond: https://github.com/octaviopardo/EBGaramond12/blob/106a4a6d377987459ae5e68673a4570f13b957fb/OFL.txt
  Garamond-Math: https://github.com/YuanshengZhao/Garamond-Math/blob/42b7c154422ae45e6f834654648da4ac467c656b/LICENSE
  Chinese text uses ChillKai; Source Han Serif SC is a printed-book alternative.
  Both are separately available under OFL-1.1 and are not bundled.
  Source Han Serif: https://github.com/adobe-fonts/source-han-serif/blob/7889f11bf31170b5d092a083b357c8c8130f89e0/LICENSE.txt
  ChillKai: https://github.com/Warren2060/Chillkai/blob/ab172bd33249136db70e177e8a22d3ae721652dd/LICENSE
  Font embedding does not impose OFL on the document itself.
  The alternative Libertinus/New Computer Modern pair is embedded in Typst.

Starter dependency (removable with the drop-cap wrapper):
  The starter imports droplet 0.3.1 by Eric Biedert from Typst Universe.
  Droplet is separately licensed under MIT; its source is not copied here.
  https://github.com/typst/packages/blob/4d52f815df4d7789a48646033f32927ff6f92b92/packages/preview/droplet/0.3.1/LICENSE

Compiler:
  Typst 0.15.0 or newer is a separately distributed Apache-2.0 tool.
  https://github.com/typst/typst/blob/v0.15.0/LICENSE
